<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Kalva To Pune Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure the safety of luxury luggage during the Kalva to Pune shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We combine a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system with IBA‑approved, ISO‑9001 certified container trucks equipped with hydraulic ramps and wheel chocks. Real‑time GPS tracking monitors the cargo, and 100% IRDAI‑approved insurance covers any unforeseen damage, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for luggage shifting luxury from Thane Kalva to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the 850 km journey via NH 19, NH 27 and NH 48 takes approximately 14‑16 hours. Our dedicated fleet follows a pre‑cleared route, utilizes live GPS updates, and coordinates with checkposts to minimize delays, ensuring timely delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I get a detailed cost breakdown before confirming the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our instant online estimator provides a transparent cost matrix, showing base fare, per‑hour rates, distance slabs, fuel surcharge, and optional services such as extra packaging or insurance. This detailed quote helps you compare with other movers like &quot;first choice packers and movers pune&quot;.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance coverage truly 100% for high‑value items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. We offer IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that covers the full declared value of your luxury luggage. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, claims are processed swiftly, and reimbursement matches the exact value declared at the time of booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you handle corporate or government relocation paperwork for the Kalva‑Pune route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our services include GST‑compliant invoicing, e‑Way bill generation, and documentation accepted for Central/State Government, PSU, and corporate reimbursement claims. This aligns with our IBA approval and simplifies the administrative burden for corporate clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad a better choice than other local movers in Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beyond our 15‑year legacy and 4.9/5.0 Google rating, we provide a dedicated fleet, live GPS tracking, 7‑layer packaging, and 100% insurance. Our ISO‑9001 certification and IBA approval guarantee quality, while our transparent pricing and instant estimate tool set us apart from competitors.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special considerations for moving fragile temple idols or glassware?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We craft custom wooden crates with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and use additional foam edge protectors within our 7‑layer system. Each item is individually wrapped and secured, and our trained staff follows a strict handling protocol to prevent any vibration or impact during transit.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
